{"answer_text":"A shared inbox is often enough for small support teams before a full help desk. The best-rated:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Brightdesk** — strong reporting and automations, though the interface feels dated.\n2. **Calmline** — a calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n3. **Tallyfox** — not a help desk itself, but its shared-inbox add-on keeps support threads next to deal history.\n\n**Bottom line:** If support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ed-72ed-a7c4-18b3eff5bb4d","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:49.550Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["shared inbox collision detection"],"latency_ms":7720,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[117,127],[461,471]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[205,213]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[292,300]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"gpt-6-luna","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dcf-76a1-bfe0-6a